meta {
  name: 08_AuthorizationBoundaries
  seq: 8
}

docs {
  Scenario: The authorization boundaries of the service owner endpoint

    When the request carries no token
    Then it fails with 401
    When the request carries a token whose scope the policy does not accept
    Then it fails with 403
    When the request carries the resource owner scope, or the admin scope
    Then it succeeds, since the policy accepts either
}
